pageKey: corporate-contact
heroImage: /images/price-hero-img3898.jpg
heroImageAlt: 熊本・上通のZenNu WELLNESS DESIGN受付カウンターとロゴウォール
heroKicker: CORPORATE CONTACT / KUMAMOTO
heroTitleEn: FOR BUSINESS
